Package: utilscidados
Title: Internal Helper Functions for Data Work at Insper Cidades
Version: 0.0.2
Authors@R:
    person("Vinicius", "Oike",
           email = "viniciusor@insper.edu.br",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-8015-9189"))
Description: Helpers used at Insper Cidades (ONMS and Cidados) to
    standardise two recurring workflows: (1) preparing datasets for
    publication on Insper's Dataverse, including multi-format exports
    with sanitised names, column-level data dictionaries, README
    skeletons, and metadata workbook management; and (2) preparing
    spatial layers for upload to Mapbox Studio (GeoPortal), including
    reprojection to WGS84 and consistent naming. Also provides a
    multi-sheet Excel writer for distributing bundled tables and
    metadata.
